IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pea-private-education`

-- Private Education Act 2009, the Schedule and ss 7, 10, 11, 14, 19, 21, 33, 34, 40 and 45 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_private-education-act-2009.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a part-time evening diploma` MEANS Course WITH
    `months long` IS 24
    `days a week` IS 2
    `hours a day` IS 3
    `leads to a diploma or degree` IS TRUE
    `leads to a certificate` IS FALSE
    `is post-secondary` IS TRUE
    `is primary or secondary` IS FALSE
    `follows a foreign or international curriculum` IS FALSE
    `is special education for students with disabilities` IS FALSE
    `prepares for an outside qualification or an admission exam` IS FALSE
    `is an apprenticeship` IS FALSE
    `is given by an employer only to its own employees` IS FALSE

